                <p>Source consists of a full score bound in brown cardboard and comprises 40 leaves. Each page is numbered in the upper outer corner. Contents: p. 1: title and composer's note; p. 2&#x2013;48: music (TumW C.5.1 to TumW C.5.9; caption title on p. 2: &#x201C;In Caena Domini.&#x201D;; printed staff paper (&#x201C;C. A. KLEMM. | A. N&#xB0; 4.&#x201D;), 16 staves (8 mm) with music in black ink); and p. 49&#x2013;80: music (TumW C.5.10 to TumW C.5.15; caption title on p. 49: &#x201C;In Parasceve.&#x201D;).</p>
